<Legal lang="en" route="cookies" title="Cookies · Casa Pelletier" description="Cookies and trackers used on casapelletier.fr, and how to manage your consent." h1="Cookies" updated="Last updated: November 2026">
  <p>This site uses <strong>no advertising cookies and no analytics</strong>. Fonts are self-hosted.</p>
  <h2>What we store</h2>
  <ul><li><strong>cp-consent</strong> (browser local storage): remembers your choice about the Google Map for 6 months. Strictly necessary.</li></ul>
  <h2>Third-party content</h2>
  <ul><li><strong>Google Maps</strong>: the map is only loaded if you accept it. Google may then set its own cookies.</li></ul>
  <h2>Change your choice</h2>
  <p><button type="button" data-cookie-open class="btn-dark cursor-pointer">Cookie settings</button></p>
</Legal>
